H03-CAS.raw:
```sql
SELECT strftime('%Y-%m', ausst_dat) AS month, SUM(brutto_usd) AS invoice_amount, SUM(SUM(brutto_usd)) OVER (ORDER BY strftime('%Y-%m', ausst_dat)) AS running_total FROM rech_kopf WHERE strftime('%Y', ausst_dat) = '2025' GROUP BY month;
```

H03-SCH.raw:
```sql
SELECT strftime('%Y-%m', ausst_dat) AS month, SUM(brutto_usd) AS total_brutto_usd, SUM(SUM(brutto_usd)) OVER (ORDER BY strftime('%Y-%m', ausst_dat)) AS running_total_brutto_usd FROM rech_kopf WHERE strftime('%Y', ausst_dat) = '2025' GROUP BY month;
```

H03-BIZ.raw:
```sql
SELECT strftime('%Y-%m', rech_kopf.ausst_dat) AS month, SUM(rech_kopf.brutto_usd) AS billed_revenue, SUM(SUM(rech_kopf.brutto_usd)) OVER (ORDER BY strftime('%Y-%m', rech_kopf.ausst_dat)) AS ytd_cumulative FROM rech_kopf WHERE strftime('%Y', rech_kopf.ausst_dat) = '2025' GROUP BY month ORDER BY month;
```

